WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,850
He jumped off the building at school

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,850
He called me many times before he jumped

3
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:07,250
He said he didn't want to study, so I scolded him and forced him to go back.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:08,650
I found out later

5
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,780
He was bullied by those beasts at school

6
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,180
It's all my fault

7
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:16,850
I've had a problem with that little sister and brother

8
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:18,450
Want me to be your sister

9
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:20,580
I will only do your best

10
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,180
You avenged him

11
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,580
Still protecting girls like him

12
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:25,980
Very excellent

13
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:33,030
Can you call me brother again?

14
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,100
Then why are you considering following me?

15
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:36,700
Brother, do it with you

16
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,700
I will definitely protect you from now on.
